  "solution": "Tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> nên đường thẳng có hệ số góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì tiếp tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>Δ</mi></semantics></math> vuông góc với đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên hệ số góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>k</mi></semantics></math> của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>Δ</mi></semantics></math> thỏa mãn \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tGọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là tiếp điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>Δ</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó \n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, phương trình tiếp tuyến cần tìm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>47</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>47</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
